<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strĭo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a.
			stria, <i>to furnish with furrows</i> or
				<i>channels; to hollow out</i>, <i>groove</i>, <i>flute</i>, <i>striate</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">columnas viginti striis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 4,
					3 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">asparagum in toros,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 8, 42, § 146</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concham,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
					33, 52, § 102</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lilium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 5, 11, § 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virgula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 1, 7, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conchula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 297, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frons striata,</span>”
				<i>wrinkled</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. M. 10, p. 239, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
